==Description==
'''Elf Present''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Operation I.C.E Event]]. It was obtained from Level 19 of the premium track, which costs {{Bell|590}} or {{Robux|68}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|5,460}} or {{Robux|1,475}}.

==Appearance==
This sticker showcases the [[Bomber Elf (Unit)|Bomber Elf]] holding its bomb towards the camera, though it is colored red instead of black. It plays the default sound effect for stickers when used.

